  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个由 Serilum 制作的模组。用心打造。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>「即将消失的鸡蛋孵化」是一个极简可配置模组，它允许地面上的鸡蛋在即将消失前孵化。为防止无限生成小鸡，默认将新生成的小鸡数量限制为 50 只。物品（和鸡蛋）在 6000 刻（即 5 分钟）后消失。默认情况下，只有鸡蛋在干草块上消失时才会孵出小鸡。这能防止已加载区块中的野生鸡群规模过大。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective 模组\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于「原版体验」整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 合集包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>eggOnlyHatchesWhenOnTopOfHayBlock</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: true<br>启用时，鸡蛋仅当放置在干草块上方时才会孵化。这防止了野生鸡群在您不知情的情况下扩张。<br><br><span><strong>eggWillHatchChance</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: 1.0，最小值: 0，最大值: 1.0<br>若实体限制器未激活，鸡蛋在消失前孵化的概率。<br><br><span><strong>onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: 50，最小值: 0，最大值: 1000<br>防止过多实体孵化。仅当在鸡蛋周围 'radiusEntityLimiterCheck' 方块半径内的小鸡数量少于设定值时，即将消失的鸡蛋才会孵化。<br><br><span><strong>radiusEntityLimiterCheck</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: 32，最小值: 1，最大值: 256<br>用于 'onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan' 的检测半径（以方块为单位）。<br><br><span><strong>newHatchlingIsBaby</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值: true<br>若启用，新孵出的小鸡为幼年形态。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>（以下示例中消失计时器设为 1 秒）</em></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/despawning-eggs-hatch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组，前提是下载链接仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 的平台生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
